  "lesson": {
    "language": "zh-CN",
    "meta": "交互解题 · 空间折线",
    "title": "已知空间中五个点 $A,B,C,D,E$ 满足 $AB=BC=CD=DE=EA$，且 $\\angle ABC,\\angle BCD,\\angle CDE,\\angle DEA,\\angle EAB$ 中有四个是直角，求最后一个角的所有可能大小",
    "answerLabel": "最后一个角的可能大小",
    "answers": [
      {
        "label": "情形一",
        "value": "$60^{\\circ}$"
      },
      {
        "label": "情形二",
        "value": "$\\arccos\\left(-\\dfrac{5}{14}\\right)$"
      }
    ]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "title": "折成单位向量链",
      "content": "<p>令 $\\vec v_1=\\overrightarrow{AB},\\ldots,\\vec v_5=\\overrightarrow{EA}$，则 $|\\vec v_i|=1$ 且 $\\vec v_1+\\cdots+\\vec v_5=\\vec 0$。</p><p>顶点角为 $90^{\\circ}$ 当且仅当相邻向量垂直：$\\vec v_i\\cdot\\vec v_{i+1}=0$。四个直角意味着五个相邻对里恰有四对垂直。</p>",
      "highlight": [
        "Axis",
        "Point_A",
        "Point_B",
        "Point_C",
        "Point_D",
        "Point_E",
        "Line_AB",
        "Line_BC"
      ],
      "cameraPos": {
        "x": 4.94,
        "y": 4.08,
        "z": 5.03
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "情形一：最后一个角为 $60^{\\circ}$",
      "content": "<p>不妨设 $\\vec v_1=(1,0,0)$，$\\vec v_2=(0,1,0)$，后面三个单位向量依次垂直。其中一解把 $E$ 送到 $\\bigl(\\dfrac{1}{2},0,\\dfrac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\bigr)$，折线 $ABCDE$ 如图中实线。</p><p>$\\angle EAB$ 满足 $\\cos\\angle EAB=\\overrightarrow{AE}\\cdot\\overrightarrow{AB}=\\dfrac{1}{2}$，故最后一个角为 $60^{\\circ}$。</p>",
      "highlight": [
        "Point_A",
        "Point_B",
        "Point_C",
        "Point_D",
        "Point_E",
        "Line_AB",
        "Line_BC",
        "Line_CD",
        "Line_DE",
        "Line_EA",
        "Plane_EAB"
      ],
      "cameraPos": {
        "x": 4.69,
        "y": 5.2,
        "z": 4.05
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "情形二：最后一个角为 $\\arccos\\bigl(-\\dfrac{5}{14}\\bigr)$",
      "content": "<p>另一解共用折线 $ABCD$，把 $E$ 换到 $E'\\bigl(-\\dfrac{5}{14},\\dfrac{6}{7},\\dfrac{3\\sqrt{3}}{14}\\bigr)$（图中虚线）。</p><p>$\\cos\\angle E'AB=-\\dfrac{5}{14}$。两种本质不同的构型给出最后一个角的所有可能：$60^{\\circ}$ 或 $\\arccos\\left(-\\dfrac{5}{14}\\right)$。</p>",
      "highlight": [
        "Point_A",
        "Point_B",
        "Point_C",
        "Point_D",
        "Point_E2",
        "Line_AB",
        "Line_BC",
        "Line_CD",
        "Line_DE2",
        "Line_E2A",
        "Plane_E2AB"
      ],
      "cameraPos": {
